    "value": "prefix sdh:<https://sdhss.org/ontology/core/>\nprefix crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/>\n\nselect\t?class (count(*) as ?num)\n where {\n    ?s a crm:E21;\n        ?p ?o.\n    ?s1\t?p1 ?s ;\n         a ?class.\n    minus{?s ?p crm:E21}\n}\ngroup by ?class\nlimit 10",
